Package: Tdata
Title: Provide basic utilities for trading IBKR account
Version: 5.10.18
Authors@R: person("Alexis", "Martin", , "aldohlys@gmail.com", role =
        c("aut","cre"), comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: This package contains various R and Python functions that
        are to be used in cunjunction with an IBKR and other account.
        More specifically, it is interfaced with ib_insync Python
        package to get all TWS functions through the TWS API.
